{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://tiniuc.com/botnet-of-ares/", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        \n        <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" >\n        <meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\n\n        <!-- SEO -->\n        \n        <title> Botnet of Ares - Wishlist on Steam | Alex Tiniuc </title>\n        \n\n        <!-- Enable responsiveness on mobile devices-->\n        <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" >\n\n        <!-- js \n        <script src=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com/theme_selector.js\"></script>\n\t-->\n\n        <!--  css -->\n        <link id=\"themeCSS\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\n                            href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com/alex.css\"\n                            />\n\n        <!-- fonts -->\n        <!-- preload  -->\n        <link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Montserrat:200,300,300i,400,500,500i,600,700,800,900|Raleway\" as=\"style\">\n        <!-- load -->\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Montserrat:200,300,300i,400,500,500i,600,700,800,900|Raleway\">\n        \n\n        \n        \n        <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/atom+xml\" title=\"Alex Tiniuc RSS\" href=\"https://tiniuc.com/atom.xml\">\n        \n        \n    <!-- MailerLite Universal -->\n    <script>\n        (function(w,d,e,u,f,l,n){w[f]=w[f]||function(){(w[f].q=w[f].q||[])\n        .push(arguments);},l=d.createElement(e),l.async=1,l.src=u,\n        n=d.getElementsByTagName(e)[0],n.parentNode.insertBefore(l,n);})\n        (window,document,'script','https://assets.mailerlite.com/js/universal.js','ml');\n        ml('account', '1282415');\n    </script>\n    <!-- End MailerLite Universal -->\n    </head>\n\n    <body onload=\"main();\">\n      \n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"openSidebarMenu\" class=\"openSidebarMenu\">\n<label class=\"menu cross menu--1\" for=\"openSidebarMenu\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 75 75\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"30\" />\n        <path class=\"line--1\" d=\"M0 40h62c13 0 6 28-4 18L35 35\" />\n        <path class=\"line--2\" d=\"M0 50h70\" />\n        <path class=\"line--3\" d=\"M0 60h62c13 0 6-28-4-18L35 65\" />\n    </svg>\n</label>\n\n<div id=\"sidebarMenu\">\n    <div class=\"menu_wrapper\">\n        <ul class=\"sidebarMenuInner\">\n            <li>\n                <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com\" >Alex Tiniuc</a>\n                <div class=\"menu_div\" ></div>\n            </li>\n            \n            \n\n\n\n<li >\n    <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com&#x2F;about-me&#x2F;\" target=\"_blank\">\n        About Me\n        <i class=\"fab fa-\"></i>\n    </a>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li >\n    <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com&#x2F;botnet-of-ares&#x2F;\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Botnet of Ares\n        <i class=\"fab fa-\"></i>\n    </a>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li >\n    <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com&#x2F;chord-chart-memo&#x2F;\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Chord Chart Memo\n        <i class=\"fab fa-\"></i>\n    </a>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li >\n    <a href=\"mailto:alex@tiniuc.com\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Contact me\n        <i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i>\n    </a>\n</li>\n\n\n\n\n\n<li >\n    <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com&#x2F;atom.xml\" target=\"_blank\">\n        atom\n        <i class=\"fas fa-rss\"></i>\n    </a>\n</li>\n\n\n\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n      \n<nav id=\"overlord\" class=\"overlord\" >\n  \n  \n<figure class=\"mini_logo \">\n    <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com\" style=\"background-image: url(/img/pipe-dream.jpg)\"></a>\n</figure>\n<h5>\n    <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com\">Alex Tiniuc</a>\n</h5>\n\n  \n\n\n\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"post_container\">\n  <article>\n    \n      <h1 class=\"article_title\"><a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com&#x2F;botnet-of-ares&#x2F;\" id=\"article_link\">Botnet of Ares - Wishlist on Steam</a></h1>\n      \n<ul class=\"frontmatter frontmatter_page\" id=\"frontmatter\">\n    <li>\n        <time class=\"article_time\" datetime=\"2025-04-08\">April 08, 2025</time>\n    </li>\n    <span class=\"dotDivider\"></span>\n    <li> 389 words </li>\n    <span class=\"dotDivider\" ></span>\n    <li> 2 min </li>\n</ul>\n\n      <p>Botnet of Ares is an incremental hacking roguelite set in a cyberpunk world where everything is connected. Unlock upgrades, expand your botnet, exploit millions of devices, optimize your network &amp; shape the future of AI. In a world where control of connection is control itself, how far will you go?</p>\n<span id=\"continue-reading\"></span><iframe src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/widget/3627290/\" frameborder=\"0\" width=\"646\" height=\"190\"></iframe>\n<p>Botnet of Ares puts you in the commander's seat of an ever-growing network of infected computers. The botnet <a href=\"https://tiniuc.com/boa-blog-2/\">grows for the sole purpose of training Ares</a>, a self-improving AI Agent capable of exploiting devices en masse.</p>\n<img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" src=\"./first-three-tasks.gif\" alt=\"A recording of Botnet of Ares, showing Ares completing three tasks which increase its power.\">\n<p>As Ares grows more powerful, so does the botnet under its control. Exploit devices ranging from consumer electronics to massive datacentres - but beware: you must carefully select the best devices for each task.</p>\n<img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" src=\"./exploit-smart-shaver.gif\" alt=\"Ares creates a small botnet consisting of vulnerable smart shavers.\">\n<p>Machines vary in computing power and parallelism levels. Optimize resource allocation and keep your botnet busy for the best results.</p>\n<img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" src=\"./unlock-serial-2.gif\" alt=\"A complex botnet is used to upgrade Ares even further.\">\n<p>Be careful! Your actions will not go unnoticed - Intrusion Countermeasure Electronics will attempt to bring an end to your expansion. Act quickly, <a href=\"https://tiniuc.com/botnet-of-ares/(@/boa-blog-3/index.md)\">reconfigure your botnet and shatter the ICE</a> before it is too late.</p>\n<img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" src=\"./ice-david-goliath.gif\" alt=\"ICE spawn after completing an upgrade. They are named David and Goliath, and the player must reallocate most of their resources in order to deal with the threat.\">\n<h2 id=\"newsletter\">Newsletter</h2>\n<p>Botnet of Ares is currently in development. Join the newsletter to stay up to date with the latest news.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-embedded\" data-form=\"WeJ9yh\"></div>\n<h2 id=\"development-blog\">Development Blog</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://tiniuc.com/boa-blog-1/\">Tasks, Workers and Machines</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tiniuc.com/boa-blog-2/\">From Single Machine to Superintelligence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tiniuc.com/boa-blog-3/\">Botnet Under Siege: Confronting Intrusion Countermeasures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tiniuc.com/boa-blog-4/\">The Nine Faces of Power in Botnet of Ares</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tiniuc.com/hacksim-on-cyberdeck/\">My Hacking Simulator runs on a Cyberdeck</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      <hr>\n\n    \n    tagged\n    \n\t<a href=\"https://tiniuc.com/tags/botnet-of-ares/\">Botnet of Ares</a>\n\t\n\t    \n\t\t\n\t\t    and\n\t\t\n\t    \n\t\n    \n\t<a href=\"https://tiniuc.com/tags/development/\">Development</a>\n\t\n\t    \n\t\n    \n\n  </article>\n</section>\n\n\n       \n\n      <footer>\n        \n          \n          \n<figure class=\"mini_logo \">\n    <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com\" style=\"background-image: url(/img/pipe-dream.jpg)\"></a>\n</figure>\n<h5>\n    <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;tiniuc.com\">Alex Tiniuc</a>\n</h5>\n\n          \n<ul class=\"social_list foot_list\">\n    \n\n\n\n<li class=\"button extra_small font_faint\">\